  "message": "FEResourceManager::CreateCopyOfTexture now copies uncompressed 2D GL_RGB and GL_RGBA textures on GPU with glCopyImageSubData; FEResourceManager::CreateCopyOfTexture now frees buffer with downloaded pixels, previously it was leaked on every copy; FEShaderUniform::LoadUniformToGPU no longer logs 'Unknown uniform type' error for texture uniforms; Renamed compactMaterialPacking uniform to bCompactPacking and declared it as bool in G-buffer PBR shader, previously it was int while FERenderer was sending bool, so value was rejected with type mismatch error on every draw; Displacement of material with compact packing is no longer multiplied by FEMetalnessMapIntensity in G-buffer PBR shader.",
